 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Substitution clauses with statt … zu",
     "texto": [
      "1. **Use and meaning**: It corresponds to \"instead of\" + infinitive. It indicates the alternative action discarded in favour of the main action carried out: **Statt das Auto zu nehmen, fahre ich mit dem Fahrrad** (instead of taking the car, I go by bike).",
      "2. **Same subject**: Like other infinitive clauses, it is only used when the subject of the action carried out and that of the discarded one coincide. If the subjects are different, the conjunction **statt dass** is used: **Er bezahlte alles, statt dass seine Freunde sich beteiligten**.",
      "3. **Position of the clause**: It can be placed before the main clause (causing the obligatory verb inversion in the main clause: **Statt zu schlafen, arbeitete er** = verb in position 1 of the main clause); or placed after the main clause: **Er arbeitete, statt zu schlafen**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
